{"about_the_game":"This Virtual Reality experience will take you into a beautiful garden, alive with wind, birds, butterflies, plants, flowers, water features, day/night cycles and more! Learn what meditation is, why to meditate, and different meditation techniques. Our guided spoken meditation that you will listen to in your garden will also teach you how to do it on your own, anywhere you are in life! Choose from many locations in the garden to relax, listen to guided meditations, or music.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338140/extras/a25eb817f14f028c7df0b5c20cf34bb5.poster.avif?t=1688061719\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338140/extras/a25eb817f14f028c7df0b5c20cf34bb5.webm?t=1688061719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338140/extras/a25eb817f14f028c7df0b5c20cf34bb5.mp4?t=1688061719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Learn to train your mind to relax and clear your thoughts which can help you focus better, get more work done and feel more alive. Learn about your mind-body connection and how improving your thoughts can make you feel less stressed and more at peace. A healthy mind can help your body work at top performance. <br><br>Choose different seasons: clear spring time, raining summers or snowy winter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338140/extras/9a0daf595c55e6c481dfc9be79bedd4b.poster.avif?t=1688061719\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338140/extras/9a0daf595c55e6c481dfc9be79bedd4b.webm?t=1688061719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338140/extras/9a0daf595c55e6c481dfc9be79bedd4b.mp4?t=1688061719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>For less than the cost of one month gym membership, you can start working the most important muscle in your body, your brain!<br>Just under 20 minutes a day could change your life. Just like exercise, it takes practice and consistency to train your mind which we will teach and guide you through every step.<br><br>With our latest free DLCs you get over 6 hours of binaural beat music, tons of spawn-able interactable workstations and objects!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338140/extras/39134250868f0effc202499a11da7400.poster.avif?t=1688061719\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338140/extras/39134250868f0effc202499a11da7400.webm?t=1688061719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338140/extras/39134250868f0effc202499a11da7400.mp4?t=1688061719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Start your journey now!<br><br>Our 1.25 patch now allows you to completely customize your garden with 25 varieties/variations of plants, a pot and a few planters. With a save/load system!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338140/extras/18552dd5992a7efa88e7c30d3701fffd.poster.avif?t=1688061719\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338140/extras/18552dd5992a7efa88e7c30d3701fffd.webm?t=1688061719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338140/extras/18552dd5992a7efa88e7c30d3701fffd.mp4?t=1688061719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>All these options are available with a simple arm menu you can use anywhere in the world! Control time of day, seasons, pause time, spawn anything and everything, your creativity is the only limit!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338140/extras/25358641e10d8859d9cd81718855c099.poster.avif?t=1688061719\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338140/extras/25358641e10d8859d9cd81718855c099.webm?t=1688061719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338140/extras/25358641e10d8859d9cd81718855c099.mp4?t=1688061719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Patch 1.3 ASMR Speaker<br>Spawn a speaker or many speakers and have a selection of over 100 ASMR loops playing around you anywhere you want!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338140/extras/b6e749a2aed01a42539a08de32c44fc0.avif?t=1688061719\" width=536 height=418 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1338140?t=1688061719","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1338140?t=1688061719","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338140/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1688061719","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338140/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1688061719","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"This Virtual Reality experience will take you into a be